        "created_at": "2019-09-26T14:58:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe a quick question-- do the players get to know the villain's health? I don't see anything about it in the rulebook (what we've seen of it). The players get to know the size of minions and lieutenants, so this would suggest that yes, they do get to know it, but in the RPG run by Christopher, it seemed like he was keeping the Villain's health a secret from the players. I imagine it significantly changes gameplay decisions one way or the other. Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:07.565Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
