        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-26T22:17:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll never forget the time we wasted a fully grown dragon with Ray of Frost because the DM told us it had 1 HP left. :B</p>\n<p>It's all about how much tension you want to have in the game, and/or how tired you are of running the darn fight. XD</p>",
