        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-26T22:20:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm likely to run this the same way I run my Pathfinder games.&nbsp; For humanoids, and I'm counting the alien races as humanoids since PF/SF tend to do so, you get to see the bar for free.&nbsp; For anything else, you need to take one out first before you get to see the bar so you can see how it responds to damage.</p>",
