        "id": 228726,
        "name": "GroggyGolem",
        "username": "GroggyGolem",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-18T03:09:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In my games, it's all about the narrative description.</p>\n<p>The villain might go from perfectly healthy with a very nice super suit</p>\n<p>to bruised and scraped by a few glancing blows</p>\n<p>to battered and wounded with a damaged suit</p>\n<p>to bleeding and ragged breath with a good chunk of their suit destroyed</p>",
